{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a sequence that multicasts elements to multiple concurrent consumers."}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"conformance":{"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Self"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Element"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},"roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:Sci7Afluents8SendableRzsAB7ElementRpzrlE5shareAA22AsyncBroadcastSequenceVyxGyF::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Afluent19CurrentValueSubjectC","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"share","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent22AsyncBroadcastSequenceV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"ShareSequence.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Afluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Afluent\/SequenceOperators\/ShareSequence.swift#L113"},"title":"share()","extendedModule":"_Concurrency","modules":[{"name":"Afluent","relatedModules":["_Concurrency"]}],"symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"share","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncBroadcastSequence","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent22AsyncBroadcastSequenceV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"code":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" that multicasts elements to multiple consumers concurrently."}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This operator is an alias for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"broadcast()"},{"type":"text","text":", providing identical behavior."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"It enables multicasting of values from the upstream sequence to multiple","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"concurrent consumers without duplicating upstream work. A consumer receives","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the elements the shared sequence reads from the upstream after the consumer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"creates its iterator; elements already read and handed out are not replayed.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Example","text":"Example","type":"heading","level":2},{"code":["\/\/ Create an AsyncStream that emits 3 random values between 1 and 5","let upstream = AsyncStream<Int> { continuation in","    continuation.yield(Int.random(in: 1...5))","    continuation.yield(Int.random(in: 1...5))","    continuation.yield(Int.random(in: 1...5))","    continuation.finish()","}","","let sharedSequence = upstream.share()","","async let firstConsumer = Task {","    for await value in sharedSequence {","        print(\"First consumer received \\(value)\")","    }","    \/\/ prints the values the shared sequence reads after this consumer subscribed","}","","async let secondConsumer = Task {","    for await value in sharedSequence {","        print(\"Second consumer received \\(value)\")","    }","    \/\/ prints the values the shared sequence reads after this consumer subscribed","}","","\/\/ A consumer that subscribes after the shared sequence has handed out values misses them.","await firstConsumer.value","await secondConsumer.value"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/currentvaluesubject\/share()"]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject\/share()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/AsyncBroadcastSequence":{"url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncbroadcastsequence","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","abstract":[{"text":"An async sequence that multicasts elements from an upstream sequence to multiple concurrent consumers.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncBroadcastSequence","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence"}]},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/CurrentValueSubject/share()":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject\/share()","url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/currentvaluesubject\/share()","abstract":[{"text":"Returns a sequence that multicasts elements to multiple concurrent consumers.","type":"text"}],"conformance":{"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Self"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Element"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}]},"title":"share()","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"share","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent22AsyncBroadcastSequenceV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}]},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent":{"abstract":[],"type":"topic","title":"Afluent","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/afluent","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent"},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/CurrentValueSubject":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CurrentValueSubject","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A subject that broadcasts its current value and all subsequent values to multiple consumers."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It can also handle completion events, including normal termination and failure with an error."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncSequence"},{"type":"text","text":" that allows multiple tasks to asynchronously consume values and mimics Combine’s CurrentValueSubject."}],"type":"topic","title":"CurrentValueSubject","url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/currentvaluesubject","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"CurrentValueSubject","kind":"identifier"}]}}}